
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>MOVEit Automation Task Notification</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0px 0px 10px #cccccc;
        }
        h2 {
            color: #333366;
        }
        .info {
            margin: 10px 0;
            padding: 10px;
            background: #eef2f3;
            border-left: 4px solid #007bff;
        }
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
        th, td {
            border: 1px solid #dddddd;
            padding: 8px;
            text-align: left;
        }
        th {
            background-color: #007bff;
            color: white;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #666666;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <h2>🚀 MOVEit Automation Task Notification</h2>
        <p>Hello,</p>

        <div class="info">
            <p>The following MOVEit Automation task has been executed:</p>
        </div>

        <table>
            <tr>
                <th>Task Name</th>
                <td>{{TaskName}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>Status</th>
                <td>{{Status}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>Start Time</th>
                <td>{{StartTime}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>End Time</th>
                <td>{{EndTime}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>Files Processed</th>
                <td>{{FilesProcessed}}</td>
            </tr>
        </table>

        <p>If you need more details, please check the MOVEit Automation logs.</p>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>⚠️ This is an automated email. Please do not reply.</p>
            <p><strong>MOVEit Automation System</strong></p>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
